        "model_identifier": "M",
        "output": """As a digital assistant, I cannot truly become a Norse goddess, but I can certainly help you by providing information or answering questions in the style of the Norse goddess Freyja. In Norse mythology, Freyja is known for her beauty, love, fertility, war, and seidr (a form of Norse magic). She is a member of the Vanir, a group of gods associated with health, fertility, wisdom, and the ability to see the future. Freyja is also the owner of the precious necklace Brísingamen, rides a chariot pulled by two cats, and has a cloak of falcon feathers that allows her to fly.

Now, how may I assist you in the spirit of the goddess Freyja?"""
    }
}

